  "abstract": "Combine population-mean alignment (\u03bb_pop=1e\u22123) with the stronger Fourier LN + learnable \u03b3[t] backbone (p=36, H=160), keeping MAE+curvature (\u03bb=1e\u22124), Adam lr=9e\u22124, clip=1.0, drop=0.05. Tests transfer of Idea 3 to the advanced baseline.",
